{"meetingId": "78", "tickets": [{"title": "Organize estate settlement planning file for Lydia Cloudpuddle", "text": "Organize the estate settlement planning file for Lydia Cloudpuddle, separating probate assets, beneficiary assets, estate professionals, family decision points, and household planning impacts. Include Nora Velvetreed's estate details, the traditional IRA at Velvet Acorn Custody (~$410,000), the taxable brokerage account at Tin Sparrow Investments (~$275,000), the condominium (~$620,000 county estimate, no mortgage), and the $25,000 charitable bequest to Moonbadger Community Arts Fund.", "priority": null, "dueDate": "2025-08-08", "assigneeId": null, "subTasks": [], "templateId": null, "evidence": "The agreed follow-up is to organize that file by 2025-08-08."}, {"title": "Resolve Missing Signature Packet", "text": "Use this workflow when a document packet cannot be submitted or finalized because one or more required signatures, initials, dates, attestations, or delivery acknowledgments are missing. Confirm the specific signature gap, contact the appropriate signer using approved communication channels, document the outreach, and verify the corrected packet before submission.

Address the inherited IRA beneficiary claim packet requirements for Lydia Cloudpuddle with Velvet Acorn Custody. Obtain a certified death certificate for Nora Velvetreed (currently only a photocopy is available), secure letters of authority, and complete the signed beneficiary claim form for the ~$410,000 traditional IRA before the custodian will establish Lydia's inherited IRA registration.", "priority": "medium", "dueDate": "2025-08-01", "assigneeId": "0d61606d-603e-57bf-ab9b-0ca9eccca1b8", "subTasks": [{"title": "Identify the exact signature deficiency", "text": "Review the inherited IRA beneficiary claim packet from Velvet Acorn Custody and note each missing item: the certified death certificate for Nora Velvetreed (currently only a photocopy), letters of authority, and the unsigned beneficiary claim form for the ~$410,000 traditional IRA. Identify signer role, document name, page or section, required signature/initial/date, and whether a witness, notary, spouse, trustee, or authorized representative is also required.", "priority": "medium", "assigneeId": "0d61606d-603e-57bf-ab9b-0ca9eccca1b8", "dueDate": null}, {"title": "Confirm follow-up approach with advisory team", "text": "Determine whether the items can be corrected electronically, require wet ink, or need new forms. If the missing items affect advice, authorization, ownership, or beneficiary instructions, confirm the next step with the advisor before contacting the signer.", "priority": "medium", "assigneeId": "bc4c93c5-32d9-5b85-8582-1740c5c570dd", "dueDate": null}, {"title": "Send signer outreach with clear instructions", "text": "Contact the appropriate signers using placeholders for [client/signer name], [document name], [signature location], [return method], and [support contact]. Include only the minimum necessary document details and avoid sending sensitive information through unapproved channels.", "priority": "medium", "assigneeId": "0d61606d-603e-57bf-ab9b-0ca9eccca1b8", "dueDate": null}, {"title": "Validate corrected packet and record completion", "text": "After the corrected documents are received, verify all required signatures and dates are present, save the final version to the appropriate client record, update the task notes with evidence collected, and route the packet for submission or advisor review as needed.", "priority": "medium", "assigneeId": "a1a32255-45db-5876-a51d-f94935e71b05", "dueDate": null}], "templateId": "e8f5e053-ae21-5df8-b21f-3b72945a5371", "evidence": "The agreed follow-up is to address the claim-packet requirements by 2025-08-01."}, {"title": "Resolve Tin Sparrow account ownership treatment for Nora's estate", "text": "Resolve the ownership treatment of the Tin Sparrow Investments brokerage account (~$275,000) from Nora Velvetreed's estate. Reconcile the transfer-on-death registration naming Lydia Cloudpuddle and Calvin Velvetreed with Paper Otter Legal's preliminary inventory listing the same account as a probate asset, so estate accounting can be finalized.", "priority": null, "dueDate": "2025-08-15", "assigneeId": null, "subTasks": [], "templateId": null, "evidence": "follow-up needed by 2025-08-15"}, {"title": "Prepare estate cash-flow calendar for Nora's condominium", "text": "Prepare a practical cash-flow calendar for Nora Velvetreed's condominium (county estimate ~$620,000, no mortgage) covering recurring expenses, likely sale-preparation costs, estate-paid items, and any personal advances by co-executors Lydia Cloudpuddle and Calvin Velvetreed. The calendar should support fair coordination between the co-executors.", "priority": null, "dueDate": "2025-08-06", "assigneeId": null, "subTasks": [], "templateId": null, "evidence": "The agreed follow-up is to prepare that calendar by 2025-08-06."}, {"title": "Complete inherited IRA distribution choice review for Lydia Cloudpuddle", "text": "Complete a planning review of available inherited IRA distribution approaches for the ~$410,000 traditional IRA at Velvet Acorn Custody inherited from Nora Velvetreed. Cover estimated taxable income effects, withholding preferences, and how different withdrawal pacing would interact with Lydia Cloudpuddle's planned retirement from Copper Firefly Design at age 62, before she signs account setup instructions.", "priority": null, "dueDate": "2025-09-05", "assigneeId": null, "subTasks": [], "templateId": null, "evidence": "The agreed follow-up is to complete that review by 2025-09-05."}, {"title": "Perform recurring beneficiary designation review", "text": "At each annual review cycle, and after any reported major life event, confirm whether beneficiary designations should be reviewed for retirement accounts, insurance policies, transfer-on-death registrations, and education accounts. Document the date of the last confirmed beneficiary review, evidence available, discrepancies found, and any forms or custodian steps needed.

Address the contingent beneficiary alignment on Lydia Cloudpuddle's older employer 401(k) at Copper Firefly Design (~$610,000), which currently names only Mara Cloudpuddle as contingent beneficiary. Update the designation so both Mara and Theo Cloudpuddle are named equally, consistent with Lydia's stated intent and the advisory records for her IRA.", "priority": "medium", "dueDate": "2025-08-22", "assigneeId": null, "subTasks": [], "templateId": "c0849ab3-1ea7-5ae4-8eb0-302abcb9d836", "evidence": "The agreed follow-up is to address the beneficiary alignment by 2025-08-22."}, {"title": "Obtain estate professional communication authorization for Lydia Cloudpuddle", "text": "Obtain a communication authorization covering Sienna Bramblequill of Paper Otter Legal and Arlo Nettlewhisk of Clockwork Clover Tax so they can discuss asset values, beneficiary registrations, basis information, and liquidity questions with Apricot Compass Advisory. The current advisory file does not include an authorization covering estate counsel.", "priority": null, "dueDate": "2025-07-30", "assigneeId": null, "subTasks": [], "templateId": null, "evidence": "The agreed follow-up is to obtain the authorization by 2025-07-30."}, {"title": "Address Velvet Acorn inherited account name correction for Lydia Cloudpuddle", "text": "Address the name correction on the Velvet Acorn Custody service record for Lydia Cloudpuddle's inherited IRA, which was opened under "Lydia Velvetreed" despite her identification and advisory records using "Lydia Cloudpuddle." Confirm the custodian corrects the registration workflow so inherited account paperwork can be accepted.", "priority": null, "dueDate": "2025-08-04", "assigneeId": null, "subTasks": [], "templateId": null, "evidence": "the agreed follow-up is to address the name correction by 2025-08-04."}]}
